sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Browser)
    participant FE as Next.js (:3000)
    participant BE as Spring Boot (:8080)
    participant Email as Email (logged)

    Note over User,Email: User lost authenticator app, uses recovery code at login

    User->>FE: Enter email + password → Sign In
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/login { email, password }
    BE->>BE: Validate credentials, mfaEnabled = true
    BE->>BE: Generate mfaToken (5min)
    BE->>Email: Send OTP (user won't receive / ignores)
    BE-->>FE: { requiresMfa: true, mfaToken }

    FE->>FE: Show OTP input form
    FE-->>User: "Nhập mã OTP hoặc mã khôi phục"

    User->>FE: Enter recovery code instead of OTP
    FE->>BE: POST /api/v1/auth/mfa/recovery { mfaToken, recoveryCode }
    BE->>BE: Validate mfaToken
    BE->>BE: Find recovery_code by userId + used=false
    BE->>BE: Compare recoveryCode with BCrypt hash

    alt Recovery code valid
        BE->>BE: Mark recovery_code.used = true
        BE->>BE: Generate access_token + refresh_token
        BE-->>FE: { accessToken, refreshToken, user }
        FE->>FE: Set cookies, setUser()
        FE-->>User: Logged in ✓

        opt Recovery codes remaining <= 3
            BE-->>FE: Warning: "Chỉ còn X mã khôi phục"
            FE-->>User: Show warning banner
        end
    else Recovery code invalid or all used
        BE-->>FE: 400 "Invalid or exhausted recovery codes"
        FE-->>User: Show error
    end
